[00:23.74]1. O Jehovah, Sov’reign Ruler,
[00:28.52]You are the one I love and obey.
[00:35.20]You deserve my full devotion;
[00:40.32]You are my God; I’ll serve you each day.
[00:46.62]Your commands I loyally follow;
[00:52.72]How I love reminders from you!
[00:59.74](Chorus)
[01:00.48]O Jehovah, you are worthy;
[01:06.28]Whole-souled devotion I give to you.
[01:12.86]2. Father, all your works exalt you.
[01:31.94]Earth, moon, and stars your glory proclaim.
[01:38.56]May I also be as faithful,
[01:43.74]Using my strength to make known your name.
[01:50.10]May I use my whole life to serve you,
[01:56.40]Proving to be loyal and true.
[02:03.96](Chorus)
[02:04.18]O Jehovah, you are worthy;
[02:10.14]Whole-souled devotion I give to you.
